{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Wave Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an intense experience! You will face waves of enemies that become increasingly challenging. Each match is a new test of your intelligence and strategy, where you must adapt, make quick decisions, and fight to the limit to survive each new horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this adventure with a squad of heroes who are more than just cats. Each of our heroes has a distinct personality and a unique story. From the tough anti-hero who doesn't care about the rules to the prankster who loves a good joke. Find the hero that matches your style and save the world with a lot of personality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't just about shooting\u2014it's about thinking. During battles, you can place towers that create a defensive barrier, help hold back enemy hordes, or provide crucial tactical support. Your choice of placement can change the course of the battle, turning an imminent defeat into an overwhelming victory. Your strategy is your best weapon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hero stronger with every victory! In your inventory, you can use the resources gained from battles to permanently enhance your hero's attributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-Ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each match, new choices appear. Combine power-ups, improve your weapon, and alter the fate of the battle with creative and unpredictable builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Monstrous Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the pinnacle of your journey! At the end of each series of waves, you will face a colossal boss, representing the greatest threat to your squad. Each boss has unique and complex attack patterns that require more than brute force. To defeat them, you'll need skill, quick reflexes, and impeccable planning.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810430?t=1771855593","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810430?t=1771855593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/6b29b061099027add37385b99f93040002144b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771855593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/6b29b061099027add37385b99f93040002144b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771855593","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4146840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Wave Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/b783e746c4a7dc26a385543f69987416.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an intense experience! You will face waves of enemies that become increasingly challenging. Each match is a new test of your intelligence and strategy, where you must adapt, make quick decisions, and fight to the limit to survive each new horde.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/664676d552ef8a51308596a07c238ec1.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this adventure with a squad of heroes who are more than just cats. Each of our heroes has a distinct personality and a unique story. From the tough anti-hero who doesn't care about the rules to the prankster who loves a good joke. Find the hero that matches your style and save the world with a lot of personality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tower Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/96fcecdb8f014330ee4fe11888c32cf6.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn't just about shooting\u2014it's about thinking. During battles, you can place towers that create a defensive barrier, help hold back enemy hordes, or provide crucial tactical support. Your choice of placement can change the course of the battle, turning an imminent defeat into an overwhelming victory. Your strategy is your best weapon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/60c28bc71f112adaf203b264386e748a.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hero stronger with every victory! In your inventory, you can use the resources gained from battles to permanently enhance your hero's attributes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-Ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/c32401de94077c90892af8d1de31dafc.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each match, new choices appear. Combine power-ups, improve your weapon, and alter the fate of the battle with creative and unpredictable builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Monstrous Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.poster.avif?t=1771855593\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.webm?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/extras/892774480c0874bea43704b504f6fce2.mp4?t=1771855593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the pinnacle of your journey! At the end of each series of waves, you will face a colossal boss, representing the greatest threat to your squad. Each boss has unique and complex attack patterns that require more than brute force. To defeat them, you'll need skill, quick reflexes, and impeccable planning.</p>","developers":["Nextframe Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810430/1346a5fbc50706735cf47595eefd55bdc40319eb/header.jpg?t=1771855593","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I3 6\u00b0gen or Superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5 6\u00b0gen or Superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minim